\[ [\text{H}_2] = \frac{P T}{RT} = \frac{1 \times 298}{8.314 \times 298} = 1.12 \, \text{M} \]  
Thus:  
\[ Q = \frac{(1.12)^2}{(0.1)^2} = 12.704 \]

